## 8. FIRST ACTION IN A NEW SESSION
1. Read this file fully (it is auto-loaded). 2. Re-hash the EA and compare to §6.
3. Read the latest BUILDER_RESULT and any master response the operator relays.
4. Do nothing else until a directive or an accepted decision memo is on the table.